# Browser test-pass scratch (Playwright artifacts + snapshots) — not part of the app
/.playwright-mcp/
/flow*.png
/flow*.md
# Dev before/after capture pairs dropped at the repo root during verification passes.
# ⚠️ ROOT-ANCHORED, like /flow*.png above: four before/after images ARE committed assets
# (doemail1-plates, doemail3-admin-email, doinv4-email-plates, email-footer). Git ignores
# never apply to already-tracked paths, so those are unaffected either way — but anchoring
# keeps this rule aimed at the scratch location rather than the filename everywhere.
/*-before-after.png

# Design source: version the .md specs (CATALOGUE + design-system + owner-portal) as the
# source-of-truth; keep the bulky raw Claude Design HTML exports OUT (104MB of self-unpacking
# bundles, regeneratable) — they are referenced by path, not committed.
/docs/design/raw/
/docs/design/*.html

# Laravel Passport OAuth signing keys — NEVER commit the private key
/storage/oauth-private.key
/storage/oauth-public.key

# Gated build browser-verification screenshots (not part of the regression net)
gate*.png
